{"creditedName":"まりの あや","creatorId":"vndb:s14991","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14991","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14991","name":"まりの あや","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:50004","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"sphere","creatorId":"vndb:s23971","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23971","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23971","name":"sphere","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:50005","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"桜田 衣咲","creatorId":"vndb:s24265","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24265","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24265","name":"桜田 衣咲","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:50006","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c40795","characterName":"周防 瀬里奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44724","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"22424"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3297"],"vndbCharacterId":"c40795"},"originalCharacterName":"周防 瀬里奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"803"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl whom Naoto met on the way to Kamimori Village. She is the daughter of the Suou family, a prominent family in Kamimori Village, but left the village with her father at a young age and has lived in the outside world ever since."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first glance she appears to be a ladylike young lady, but as she gets to know Naoto, her free-spirited and childlike nature gradually emerges. She is very curious."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40795"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"直人が上森村に向かう道中で出会った少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上森村の名家である周防家の娘だが、幼い頃に父親に連れられて村を出、外の世界で暮らしてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見お嬢様然とした雰囲気を漂わせているが、直人と親しくなっていく内に次第にその自由奔放で子供っぽい本性を現していく。好奇心旺盛。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3297","sourceWorkId":"3773","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"上森村を仕切る大地主、周防家の長男である京一と多香子が授かった双子姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上森村で生まれるが、幼少の頃にとある事件がきっかけで村を出て、遠縁の叔父夫婦の元に身を寄せ外の世界で暮らすことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"叔父夫婦の家が比較的裕福だったため、お嬢様的な上品な雰囲気を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、生い立ちのせいか外見とは裏腹に頑固で負けん気の強い部分がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"村から逃げるときに持っていたロケットを首に掛けて肌身離さず持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロケットの中には、幼い瀬里奈と、彼女にそっくりの少女の２人が写った写真が入っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーション抜群でわりと巨乳。処女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44724"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c8ec1483e70f0ef1e620e87c8c626a221da5de4364e0e83bcafa3024fbcd670.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d38ecba6099763e96abdb2c17b96b2631ce1bcec79efa6da86f579048a9e6d8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:22424:44724:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c40796","characterName":"周防 多香子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44726","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"22424"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3299"],"vndbCharacterId":"c40796"},"originalCharacterName":"周防 多香子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"517"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A woman who came from outside the village to marry Kyoichi Suou. She gave birth to two children, Yukina and Serina, with Kyoichi, but Kyoichi ran away from the village with Serina, and she was left behind in the village. She secretly hates Kyoichi and Serina for abandoning her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a voluptuous body and big breasts. She's also very beautiful."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40796"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村の外から周防京一の元に嫁いできた女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"京一との間に雪奈と瀬里奈の二人の子を授かるが、京一が瀬里奈をつれて村から逃げてしまい、彼女は村に取り残されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を捨てた京一と、瀬里奈のことを密かに憎んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豊満な身体で巨乳。かなりの美人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3299","sourceWorkId":"3773","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周防家の次の当主となる京一の元に嫁いできた女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表向きは、屋敷や村を切り盛りする厳格なおかみさん的な立場を取っているが、裏では村で唯一の医師である白河と協力して何かを企んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある理由から夫の京一と瀬里奈のことを憎んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豊満な身体で巨乳。かなりの美人。非処女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44726"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75c752c65c97e8c782ff72aa5ceb14595e432434aa5334b91fa212ef9573b63a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec0ab67c3f21834218a6f6dd0f170c62ebab90de8bad82df364c691272a7f2f9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"富山あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s891","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s891","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s891","name":"富山 あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:22424:44726:12717:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c40797","characterName":"周防 雪奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44725","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"22424"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3298"],"vndbCharacterId":"c40797"},"originalCharacterName":"周防 雪奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"803"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serina's twin sister. Ever since Serina left the village, she has been kept in the storehouse behind the Suou mansion, and is only allowed out at night."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she has a calm and kind personality, she sometimes shows an side of herself that is like a completely different person. She cares deeply for her sister and wants Serina to continue living happily in the outside world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40797"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"瀬里奈の双子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瀬里奈が村を出て以来、ずっと周防の屋敷裏にある蔵に監禁されており、外出が許されるのは夜中のみである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで心優しい性格だが、時折全く別人のような表情を見せることがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹思いで、瀬里奈にはこのまま外の世界で幸せに生きて欲しいと考えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3298","sourceWorkId":"3773","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"周防京一と多香子が授かった双子姉妹の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瀬里奈とは違い、これまでずっと上森村の中で暮らしてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある理由から雪奈はずっと周防の屋敷裏にある蔵に監禁されており、外出が許されるのは夜中のみである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかで心優しい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹思いで、瀬里奈にはこのまま外の世界で幸せに生きて欲しいと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロポーションは細身で貧乳。年齢よ